#note, for initial PSSM-based design, Rosetta wanted to mutate almost 30% of the original sequence even with strong PSSM-based biases (and using a monellin-only MSA to make the PSSM!). To prevent too many mutations from being tested at once, I focused on the mutations that scored most favorably (i.e., most negative change post-mutating) and listed those here.